<!-- 4 · THE METHOD ................................................... -->
<section class="methode" id="methode">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="methode-head">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our answer</p>
        <h2>How can we guarantee the Silver medal?</h2>
        <p>The vast majority of companies already sit at Bronze level by nature, simply because
        of the legal, social, and administrative obligations they already meet. Our expertise
        and our command of the EcoVadis platform take them to Silver.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="medaille reveal" src="/assets/img/medaille-argent.png"
           alt="EcoVadis Silver medal" width="640" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>

    <h3 class="methode-titre reveal">Our method</h3>
    <ol class="etapes">
      <li class="reveal">Detailed analysis of your score and of the documents you submitted</li>
      <li class="reveal">On-site presentation of simple, low-cost additional actions that make
        sense for your business</li>
      <li class="reveal">Collection of eligible documents and KPIs using our tool</li>
      <li class="reveal">Calculation of last year's carbon footprint</li>
      <li class="reveal">Support for the approved actions. Workshops available as an option</li>
      <li class="reveal">Drafting of policies with qualitative and quantitative targets, which
        you approve</li>
      <li class="reveal">Creation of the document structure and the tracking tables</li>
      <li class="reveal">When everything is 90% ready, you request your reassessment</li>
      <li class="reveal">Submission on time</li>
      <li class="reveal">Silver medal 4 to 6 weeks later</li>
    </ol>

    <details class="or reveal">
      <summary>And why not Gold?</summary>
      <div class="or-corps">
        <p>To earn a Gold medal, EcoVadis requires not only that every theme is covered, but
        that tracking is built into how you manage: targets, indicators, reviews, and a record
        of what they delivered. That record takes a full year, one complete cycle.
        <a href="/en/knowledge/from-silver-to-gold/">More details</a>.</p>
        <p>Silver, on the other hand, is within reach in three to four months. It comes down to
        structured policies and documented actions: showing that an action has been launched
        is enough — a purchase order, a signed charter, a dated plan.</p>
        <p class="or-chute">Let's learn to walk before we run 😉</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

